      "filename": "Besmi Alem Valide Mosque 6169.jpg",
      "title": "File:Besmi Alem Valide Mosque 6169.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/Besmi_Alem_Valide_Mosque_6169.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Besmi_Alem_Valide_Mosque_6169.jpg",
      "width": 1600,
